<title>FRANCE: France to offer 11 bln Ffr of T-bills on Monday.</title>
<headline>France to offer 11 bln Ffr of T-bills on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Treasury said it would offer 11 billion francs of bills at its next weekly tender on Monday, October 28.</p>
<p>The offering will comprise eight billion francs of 13-week bills and three billion francs of 44-week paper.</p>
<p>Payment for the 13-week paper is due on October 31. Payment for the 44-week bills is due on November 7.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
